  "explanation": "The pipeline starts by building a complete repositioning strategy, then uses an analyst to stress-test it against younger-customer relevance, loyal-customer retention, heritage credibility, and backlash risk. A refiner integrates those findings into a more actionable strategy. The quality gate reviews the refined output in detail; if it identifies substantive weaknesses, the revise route loops back to the refiner, while pass continues to the final polisher. The polisher converts the validated strategy into an executive-ready deliverable. Flow: Heritage Repositioning Strategist → Audience and Authenticity Analyst → Integrated Repositioning Refiner → Strategic Integrity Quality Gate (if revise, return to Refiner; if pass, continue) → Executive Strategy Polisher."
